# ZOOM-BOUNCE-3: a scripted pair - one inward tick, then an outward tick 5, 10 and 20 ms
# later, away from either zoom limit, reported frame by frame via the new wheel trace
# (wheel.tsv) and the presented scale (frames.tsv). Run with --gpu --trace.
look 1080 635
wait ms 1500
# pair 1: 5 ms gap
wheel 1 1080 635
wait ms 5
wheel -1 1080 635
wait ms 300
# pair 2: 10 ms gap
wheel 1 1080 635
wait ms 10
wheel -1 1080 635
wait ms 300
# pair 3: 20 ms gap
wheel 1 1080 635
wait ms 20
wheel -1 1080 635
wait ms 300
quit
